00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.490
It's designed for
the large screens,

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:40.070
and it's designed with a few
guiding principles in mind.

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:42.110
So, first of this is speed.

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:43.660
So, if you have
used Chromebooks,

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:46.640
you know that they boot
up in eight to 10 seconds.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:48.010
So, they're really fast.

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:50.380
And that was a fundamental
design consideration

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.235
for the team right
from the beginning.

00:01:53.235 --> 00:01:54.610
The other part
about Chromebooks,

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:56.900
is they're very, very simple.

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:00.697
So, if you get a new Chromebook,
you are up and running on it--

00:02:00.697 --> 00:02:02.530
if you have never used
a Chromebook before--

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:04.420
literally in a few minutes.

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:09.220
So, very easy to use for users,
but also very, very easy for

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:11.910
administrators to administrate.

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:16.225
And I think probably a lot
of people know that as well.

00:02:16.225 --> 00:02:20.850
In terms of security, security
is built into Chromebooks

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:22.090
at every layer.

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:25.300
So, starting from the hardware,
to the operating system,

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.980
to the application layer,
all the applications

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.110
are sand boxed.

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:32.390
Which means that for
all your Chrome devices,

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:35.230
you can think of it as antivirus
is automatically built in.

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:36.910
You'd never have to
worry about security

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:40.210
patches, and downloads,
and things like that.

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:43.990
And last, is that
shareability is

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:46.570
inherent to the
design of Chromebooks.

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:49.790
So, you can literally
grab any Chromebook,

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:54.470
and it's yours as soon as you
sign in, within a few seconds.

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:56.990
And that's a feature
which schools love.

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:59.870
So, students can grab any
