00:32:15.370 --> 00:32:20.560
I can do select, reposition
things to be where I want,

00:32:20.560 --> 00:32:26.420
erase, restore, et cetera, all
of those kinds of functions.

00:32:26.420 --> 00:32:28.610
So, that's great.

00:32:28.610 --> 00:32:32.320
But now, because I'm on
a convertible device--

00:32:32.320 --> 00:32:34.140
the Samsung Chromebook--

00:32:34.140 --> 00:32:38.545
I can switch out to
see this same note.

00:32:38.545 --> 00:32:40.170
That's going to head
back into it here.

00:32:48.051 --> 00:32:48.551
OK.

00:32:54.480 --> 00:32:58.230
And I can actually add
just typed notes onto this

00:32:58.230 --> 00:32:59.580
if I want to.

00:32:59.580 --> 00:33:02.040
Because my handwriting,
as you can see,

00:33:02.040 --> 00:33:04.980
is pretty atrocious, if I
have a couple of minutes

00:33:04.980 --> 00:33:09.060
after this meeting, I can
just convert these notes

00:33:09.060 --> 00:33:11.640
into typed text, and then
send them out to my colleagues

00:33:11.640 --> 00:33:15.150
afterwards-- something
they can actually read.

00:33:15.150 --> 00:33:17.250
So, that's just a
couple of the apps

00:33:17.250 --> 00:33:21.170
that we wanted to show you
that we have live here.

00:33:21.170 --> 00:33:23.680
If we just head back
to the slides, please.

00:33:23.680 --> 00:33:25.090
Thanks.

00:33:25.090 --> 00:33:29.620
But we also wanted to showcase
a few other apps very briefly.

00:33:29.620 --> 00:33:32.410
So, these Android apps aren't
just about Google Apps.

00:33:32.410 --> 00:33:33.990
Third party apps
like you've seen,

00:33:33.990 --> 00:33:35.920
and one of the key
non Google apps

00:33:35.920 --> 00:33:39.490
that we've had requests for is
Skype and Skype for Business.

00:33:39.490 --> 00:33:41.592
So, that's already
available in the Play Store,

00:33:41.592 --> 00:33:44.050
and you can go and install that
and use it, the same as you

00:33:44.050 --> 00:33:45.505
would on your mobile devices.

00:33:48.865 --> 00:33:51.670
Evernote, which
syncs across devices,

00:33:51.670 --> 00:33:54.060
so you can start exactly
where you left off.

00:33:54.060 --> 00:33:56.550
So, as in this case,
I can now pull out

00:33:56.550 --> 00:33:59.130
my phone, which is already
logged into the same account,

00:33:59.130 --> 00:34:02.610
and add on to that same
note, or start a new one.

00:34:02.610 --> 00:34:06.470
And that will be synchronized
across all of these devices.

00:34:06.470 --> 00:34:09.760
Slack-- for efficient
team communication,

00:34:09.760 --> 00:34:11.000
and rich notifications.

00:34:11.000 --> 00:34:14.179
So, inside that app,
if I get more messages

00:34:14.179 --> 00:34:18.320
from my colleagues for
a chat room that I'm in,

00:34:18.320 --> 00:34:21.020
that rich notification
will pop up in the same way

00:34:21.020 --> 00:34:23.060
that it would as if I
was on a mobile device.

00:34:25.735 --> 00:34:28.210
A ton of Google Apps,
like, for example,

00:34:28.210 --> 00:34:30.040
Google Calendar--
and the advantage

00:34:30.040 --> 00:34:31.480
here is that they work offline.

00:34:31.480 --> 00:34:35.110
So, you can check into
and read all of that data

00:34:35.110 --> 00:34:38.824
in the same way you would
as if you're on mobile.

00:34:38.824 --> 00:34:40.699
And for those of you in
the education space--

00:34:40.699 --> 00:34:42.710
and just a quick show
of hands, who here is?

