00:41:10.640 --> 00:41:13.570
We talked about Android
apps, demoed some showcase,

00:41:13.570 --> 00:41:15.740
and tips for optimizing.

00:41:15.740 --> 00:41:19.840
So, these are some
of the resources

00:41:19.840 --> 00:41:24.070
